{
  "rationale": "The plant automata model the robot's motion actions and sensor outcomes as separate subsystems. The specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforce conservative obstacle recovery, and prevent unsafe or oscillatory behaviors. Recovery actions are brief and forward progress resumes as soon as possible. Full rotation is only used after repeated failures to clear obstacles.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate motion and perception into distinct plant automata for modularity.",
    "Specifications bind sensor outcomes to safe actions, enforce conservative recovery, and prevent repeated or unsafe behaviors."
